{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f183487c-4a9e-8a78-8ea7-92f14f657478",
  "created_at": "2026-01-06T11:14:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Almy",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:11:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Sorry to bother you. Um, I'm calling about some trash that got left out on the curb. Am I calling the right office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:11:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You are, that's us. Bulk waste or regular trash?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:11:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bulk, I think. A mattress, a couple of chairs, a broken dresser, some bags. The landlord next door had a tenant move out and he just put it all out front. It's been there since the weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address where it's sitting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 170 Narragansett Avenue. That's the house with the stuff out front, not mine. I'm the neighbor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "170 Narragansett, got it. Did anyone put a sticker or a tag on it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't think so. I was trying to report it on the app, actually, but it froze on me. The screen just stopped. I'm sorry, I'll have to close it and restart it. Is that okay, or should I just tell you here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Telling me here is fine, I'm putting it in now. Don't worry about the app."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Thank you. Am I doing this right? I didn't want to give the wrong information."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing fine. Is it blocking the sidewalk at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A little. The mattress is leaning over the edge, so people have to step into the street to get around it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:12:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, I'll note that. Usually bulk items need to be scheduled ahead of time, so a landlord dumping it after a move-out is something we'd have to look into."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's what I figured. Um, would it be possible for a supervisor to call me back about it? I'd just like to know what's going to happen. Sorry, I know that's a lot to ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a lot at all. I'll put in a request for a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me read that back. 401-555-0173."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right. And that's a cell, so it should come through."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Doug Almy. A-L-M-Y."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:42-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Mr. Almy. I have you down for a callback from a supervisor about the bulk waste at 170 Narragansett Avenue. They'll probably reach you sometime today or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:13:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I don't need to do anything else? I don't have to redo it on the app?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:14:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're all set. No need to do it twice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:14:04-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thank you very much, and sorry again for the trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:14:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-06T11:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
